---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, RSS_URL } from '../consts';
import portrait from '../assets/me.jpeg';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="About Tim Hilt">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<!-- Displayed at most 20rem wide (see style below); 2x widths cover high-DPI screens. -->
	<Image
		src={portrait}
		alt="Portrait of Tim Hilt"
		width={640}
		widths={[320, 640]}
		sizes="(max-width: 22rem) 100vw, 20rem"
	/>

	<p>
		Hi, I'm Tim. I believe most problems at work aren't technical: they come from poor communication
		and organization. That's why I care about clarity, both in how teams work together and in how
		software is built.
	</p>
	<p>
		At <ExternalLink href="https://festo.com">Festo</ExternalLink> in Esslingen, Germany, I evolve
		the architecture of a large embedded software platform (>1M LOC), with a focus on performance
		and low memory footprint. I also coach our engineers in agentic coding to help them become more
		productive.
	</p>
	<p>
		I like Espresso, Split Mechanical Keyboards and Road Cycling. I'm married and a father of three
		boys. I'm a follower of Jesus Christ and invest in young children by teaching in sunday school.
	</p>
	<p>
		Follow along via <a href={RSS_URL}>RSS</a>, or connect with me on{' '}
		<ExternalLink href={LINKEDIN_URL}>LinkedIn</ExternalLink> or{' '}
		<ExternalLink href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</ExternalLink>.
	</p>
</Page>

<style>
	img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 20rem;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
